    "body": "I haven't thought too hard about this, but it seems like there may be other cases where a popover can be hidden while it's showing, eg calling `hidePopover()` in this event.\r\n\r\nThis is one of those cases, since removing a popover also hides the element.\r\n\r\nIt feels like hiding a showing popover should end with it being in the hidden state.",
