    "updated_at": "2023-04-17T21:24:36Z",
    "body": "> The element could move to other document. For instance, https://jsbin.com/yizayoyemu/edit?html,js,output\r\n\r\nYeah this demo crashes the renderer in chromium 😅 \r\nMaybe it would make sense to pass in an \"expected\" document to \"check popover validity\" so we can bail when the popover is being moved between documents.\r\nI'll start working on a fix for this",
